# `claim_output`'s exclusive-lock sidecars. Transient: created beside an artifact while a
# driver holds it and removed on release, so a crashed run can leave one behind. They are
# machine state, never results, and committing one would make a stale lock look authoritative
# to the next checkout.
*.json.lock

# Local agent tooling
.claude/
